stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Pending: AI Plan read, plan composed
  Pending --> Pending: reading on cadence, no rule fires
  Pending --> Overdue: reading missed (days past cadence)
  Overdue --> AwaitingApproval: ENG-1 2 d / ENG-2 5 d / ENG-3 AI call 10 d drafted
  Pending --> AwaitingApproval: pathway rule fires (draft)
  Pending --> NeedsClinician: red flag (urgent alert, no draft)
  AwaitingApproval --> ActionTaken: clinician approves or edits, sent
  AwaitingApproval --> Pending: clinician rejects (reason kept)
  ActionTaken --> Pending: reading or reply arrives
  ActionTaken --> NeedsClinician: call handoff, or two missed calls (ENG-4)
  Overdue --> NeedsClinician: ENG-4 21 d or no device (ENG-DEV)
  Pending --> Ongoing: at goal (BP-5, COPD-4, DM-4)
  Ongoing --> Pending: next review
  NeedsClinician --> Pending: clinician resolves
  Ongoing --> Complete: clinician closes plan
  Complete --> [*]
